About

A magic academy marketplace where students buy and sell spell gear.

Look: storybook illustrations, deep purple and gold, glowing spell icons, a wizard shopkeeper portrait.

RoleColor	Hex
Background / navbar	Deep Midnight Purple	
#2B1B4D
Accent / buttons / prices	Enchanted Gold	
#F2B83D
Cards / panels	Parchment Cream	
#F6ECD2
Highlights / hover glow	Arcane Teal	
#3FD0C9

Bonus: school colors for product categories

Flame: 
#E4572E
Frost: 
#6EC6FF
Storm: 
#B58CFF
Nature: 
#6BBF59
Shadow: 
#4A4458

Currency: Gems or Crowns

20-item starter list
-Wearables: pointed hats, robes, boots, rings, amulets
-Weapons: wands, staffs, daggers, spell books, crystal orbs
-Companions: baby dragon, owl, ghost cat, living-plant pet, floating jellyfish
-Consumables: healing potions, mana tonics, reagent pouches, spell scrolls, treasure maps

Storefront: shopkeeper greeting plus “Featured Spells”
Login/Registration: “Enroll at the Academy” with a character creator
User Profile: wizard card with school, level, and inventory
FAQ: “Ask the Professor” dialogue box
Navbar: Shop, Sell, Inventory, Quests, Help
Search: a spellbook search bar with school filters


